        <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/std-msgs> ;
    rdfs:comment "Package: adi_imu | Description: Publisher for ADI IMUs | Function: ROS2 driver that reads data from Analog Devices IMUs and publishes sensor measurements | Use Cases: Navigation, stabilization, and instrumentation, Unmanned and autonomous vehicles, Smart agriculture and construction machinery, Factory/industrial automation, robotics, Virtual/augmented reality, Internet of Moving Things | Hardware Required: Raspberry Pi 3 or 4, AD-IO driver (adis16475), LibIIO v0.25, ROS2 Humble | Hardware Supported: ADIS16465, ADIS16467, ADIS16470, ADIS16475, ADIS16477, ADIS16500, ADIS16501, ADIS16505, ADIS16507, ADIS16545, ADIS16547, ADIS16575, ADIS16576, ADIS16577 | Categories: perception, navigation"^^xsd:string .

