    and mapping (SLAM) in 2D and 3D across multiple platforms and sensor
    configurations. This package provides Cartographer's RViz integration.
  """^^xsd:string,
        "Use case: Displaying maps and pose trajectories generated by Cartographer in a ROS environment"^^xsd:string,
        "Use case: Integrating Cartographer SLAM with other ROS components for navigation and exploration tasks"^^xsd:string,
        "Use case: Visualizing real‑time Cartographer SLAM output in RViz for debugging and monitoring"^^xsd:string ;
