    rdfs:comment """Package: cartographer_rviz | Description: 
    Cartographer is a system that provides real-time simultaneous localization
    and mapping (SLAM) in 2D and 3D across multiple platforms and sensor
    configurations. This package provides Cartographer's RViz integration.
   | Function: Provides RViz integration for Cartographer's real‑time SLAM, enabling visualization of pose, trajectories, and maps within ROS. | Use Cases: Visualizing real‑time Cartographer SLAM output in RViz for debugging and monitoring, Displaying maps and pose trajectories generated by Cartographer in a ROS environment, Integrating Cartographer SLAM with other ROS components for navigation and exploration tasks | Algorithms: SLAM | Hardware Supported: laser scanner, IMU, GPS | Categories: localization, mapping"""^^xsd:string .

