    rdfs:comment "Package: dual_laser_merger | Description: The ira_laser_tools package. These nodes are meant to provide some utils for lasers, like listen to different laser scan sources and merge them in a single scan or generate virtual laser scans from a pointcloud. | Function: Merge multiple same‑plane laser scans into a single scan and generate virtual laser scans from pointclouds. | Use Cases: Merging multiple laser scans for SLAM algorithms like gmapping, amcl, and pamcl on vehicles equipped with multiple single‑plane laser scanners, Generating virtual laser scans from pointcloud data for use in SLAM or other perception tasks | Algorithms: laser scan merging, virtual laser scan generation from pointcloud | Hardware Required: laser scanners, pointcloud sensor | Hardware Supported: single‑plane laser scanners, multi‑plane laser scanners such as Velodyne | Categories: perception, mapping"^^xsd:string .

