    ros:supportsHardware hw:LaserScanner ;
    rdfs:comment """Package: kobuki_ros | Description: 
    ROS 2 runtime software for Kobuki, Yujin Robot's mobile research base.
   | Function: Provides ROS 2 runtime software and wrappers for the Kobuki mobile base, enabling integration of its C++ driver and ROS tools for controlling and monitoring the robot. | Use Cases: Mobile robot research and experimentation, TurtleBot reference platform, ROS tutorials and demos, Robot navigation and control | Hardware Required: Kobuki mobile base | Hardware Supported: Kobuki mobile base, Optional sensors such as bump sensors, IR rangefinders, and optional laser scanners | Categories: control, perception, navigation, turtlebot"""^^xsd:string .

