        <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/ros-gz-sim>,
        <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/ros-gz-sim-demos> ;
    rdfs:comment "Package: ros_gz | Description: Meta-package containing interfaces for using ROS 2 with  | Function: Provides ROS 2 interfaces and integration tools for Gazebo Simulation (Gazebo Sim), enabling bidirectional communication, transport bridges, and launch utilities between ROS 2 and Gazebo. | Use Cases: Running Gazebo Sim environments with ROS 2 nodes for development and testing., Bridging image streams from Gazebo to ROS image_transport topics via ros_gz_image., Bridging arbitrary Gazebo Transport topics to ROS and vice versa with ros_gz_bridge., Launching simulation scenarios with convenient ROS launch files provided by ros_gz_sim., Publishing simulated point cloud data from Gazebo to ROS using ros_gz_point_cloud., Demonstrating ROS–Gazebo integration in sample demos via ros_gz_sim_demos. | Categories: simulation, perception"^^xsd:string .

