<http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/rosbridge-suite> a ros:ROSPackage ;
    rdfs:label "Rosbridge Suite"^^xsd:string ;
    dcterms:description """
Rosbridge provides a JSON API to ROS functionality for non-ROS programs.
There are a variety of front ends that interface with rosbridge, including
a WebSocket server for web browsers to interact with.

Rosbridge_suite is a meta-package containing rosbridge, various front end
packages for rosbridge like a WebSocket package, and helper packages.
  """^^xsd:string,
        "Use case: Integration of external applications (Java, Python, Rust) with ROS"^^xsd:string,
        "Use case: Providing a JSON-based interface for ROS services and parameter server access"^^xsd:string,
        "Use case: Remote robot monitoring and interaction through web browsers"^^xsd:string,
        "Use case: Web-based ROS visualization and control dashboards"^^xsd:string ;
    ros:distribution "humble"^^xsd:string ;
    ros:lastUpdated "2025-11-11"^^xsd:date ;
    ros:licenseType "BSD"^^xsd:string ;
    ros:maintainer "Błażej Sowa <blazej@fictionlab.pl>"^^xsd:string ;
    ros:packageName "rosbridge_suite"^^xsd:string ;
    ros:packageVersion "3.0.0"^^xsd:string ;
    ros:primaryFunction "Provide a JSON API (rosbridge) that enables non-ROS programs—including web browsers, Java, Python, and Rust clients—to publish/subscribe to ROS topics, call services, and query parameters via WebSocket or TCP."^^xsd:string ;
    ros:repositoryURL "https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    ros:rosVersion "ROS 2"^^xsd:string ;
    ros:runtimeDependsOn <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/rosapi>,
        <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/rosbridge-library>,
        <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/rosbridge-server> ;
    rdfs:comment """Package: rosbridge_suite | Description: 
Rosbridge provides a JSON API to ROS functionality for non-ROS programs.
There are a variety of front ends that interface with rosbridge, including
a WebSocket server for web browsers to interact with.

Rosbridge_suite is a meta-package containing rosbridge, various front end
packages for rosbridge like a WebSocket package, and helper packages.
   | Function: Provide a JSON API (rosbridge) that enables non-ROS programs—including web browsers, Java, Python, and Rust clients—to publish/subscribe to ROS topics, call services, and query parameters via WebSocket or TCP. | Use Cases: Web-based ROS visualization and control dashboards, Remote robot monitoring and interaction through web browsers, Integration of external applications (Java, Python, Rust) with ROS, Providing a JSON-based interface for ROS services and parameter server access"""^^xsd:string .

