        <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/libg2o>,
        <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/mbf-costmap-core>,
        <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/mbf-msgs>,
        <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/message-runtime>,
        <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/nav-core>,
