        <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/visualization-msgs> ;
    rdfs:comment """Package: teb_local_planner | Description: 
    The teb_local_planner package implements a plugin
    to the base_local_planner of the 2D navigation stack.
    The underlying method called Timed Elastic Band locally optimizes
    the robot's trajectory with respect to trajectory execution time,
    separation from obstacles and compliance with kinodynamic constraints at runtime.	
   | Function: Optimizes 2D robot trajectories in real-time using the Timed Elastic Band method, providing a plugin for the ROS 2D navigation stack's base_local_planner. | Use Cases: Real‑time local path planning and obstacle avoidance for mobile robots, Trajectory optimization for autonomous navigation in simulation or on real hardware, Car‑like robot planning with kinodynamic constraints | Algorithms: Timed Elastic Band, kinodynamic trajectory optimization | Hardware Supported: Differential drive robots, Car‑like robots | Categories: navigation, control"""^^xsd:string .

