        <http://www.ros.org/ontology#package/std-msgs> ;
    ros:supportsHardware hw:Camera,
        hw:GPS,
        hw:IMU,
        hw:LaserScanner ;
    rdfs:comment "Package: sensor_msgs | Description: A package containing some sensor data related message and service definitions. | Function: Provide standardized message and service definitions for sensor data to enable inter-stack communication in ROS. | Use Cases: Publishing sensor data (e.g., images, laser scans, IMU readings) from hardware nodes., Subscribing to sensor data in perception, navigation, or other processing nodes., Facilitating communication between independent ROS packages without circular dependencies. | Hardware Supported: camera, lidar/laser scanner, IMU, GPS, other sensors | Categories: perception"^^xsd:string .

